WEBVTT

00:16:58.121 --> 00:17:01.787
communities are built on an openness
to the normal human emotions.

00:17:02.537 --> 00:17:05.829
It's this that allows us to say,
what is my emotion?

00:17:05.829 --> 00:17:10.121
Telling me which action will
bring me towards my values,

00:17:10.121 --> 00:17:12.288
which will take me away from my values.

00:17:13.746 --> 00:17:18.704
Emotional agility is the ability to be
with your emotions, with curiosity,

00:17:18.996 --> 00:17:24.288
compassion, and especially the courage
to take values, connected steps.

00:17:26.246 --> 00:17:29.371
When I was little, I would wake up at
night terrified by the idea of death,